  "#79-75: Parallel processing powerhouses ⚡\n\nfan-out-fan-in: splits tasks, processes parallel, merges output\ntriage: classifies & routes to specialized handlers\npanel: specialist AI review with moderator synthesis\nmeeting-briefer: parallel context gathering",
  "#74-70: Sales & customer intelligence 💰\n\nfriday-bot: weekly status from GitHub/Linear/Slack\ndebate: structured AI debates with judge decisions\nRevenue Scout: finds hidden sales opportunities\nlead-enricher: transforms raw leads into structured profiles",
  "#69-65: Smart routing & classification 🎯\n\nLead Router: intake → scoring → approval → CRM routing\nSupport Deflector: triages tickets, drafts responses\nservice-desk-dispatcher: classifies, routes to specialists\nsocial-inbox-router: triages social messages",
  "#64-60: Data processing pipelines 📊\n\nfinancial-inbox-guard: monitors finance emails, extracts data\nInvoice Approval Watch: automates accounts payable\nForm Filler Assistant: extracts fields, collects missing info\nETL & Blog Analyzer: structured transformation",
  "#59-55: Specialized extraction tools 🔧\n\nDynamic Schema Enricher: selects schemas by document type\nTyped Extractor Stage: messy text → clean typed objects\nExtract Anything Workbench: tests approaches, recommends best\nrunbook-executor: automates safe steps",
